{"content_hash": "f9fd5b22b8ccb831", "version_id": 614, "article_id": 62, "level_code": "en_b2", "lang": "en", "level": 4, "level_label": "B2 中高级", "title": "Williams fans 12 as Guardians beat White Sox to reach ALCS", "title_zh": "威廉姆斯飙12次三振，守护者淘汰白袜晋级美联冠军赛", "has_translation": true, "topic": "sports", "source": "guardian_sport", "source_url": "https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/oct/10/cleveland-guardians-chicago-white-sox-alds-game-five-gavin-williams", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1780476871585-eb2a20b32d12?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8OHx8d2lsbGlhbXMlMjBzdHJpa2VzJTIwb3V0fGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTE3NjU5NzV8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Diego Corona on Unsplash", "author": "Diego Corona", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@cldiego?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/mma-fighters-grapple-and-punch-inside-a-fenced-fighting-cage-3Hw-Pc1Oovk?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(306, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(344, 46%, 48%)", "label": "SPORTS", "seed": "9eb22a7a824f"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-11", "word_count": 267, "reading_minutes": 1.3, "lead": "Gavin Williams struck out 12 batters as the Cleveland Guardians beat the Chicago White Sox 2-0 on Saturday. The win completed a comeback from a 2-0 series deficit and sent Cleveland to the American League Championship Series.", "lead_zh": "加文·威廉姆斯投出12次三振，克利夫兰守护者队周六以2比0击败芝加哥白袜队。这场胜利让他们从0比2落后的局面中翻盘，成功晋级美国联盟冠军赛。", "preview": "Gavin Williams struck out 12, and José Ramírez hit a two-run homer just above home plate as the Cleveland Guardians beat the Chicago White S", "preview_zh": "加文·威廉姆斯投出12次三振，何塞·拉米雷斯在好球带上沿击出一支两分全垒打，帮助克利夫兰守护者队周六晚以2比0击败芝加哥白袜队。这场胜利让他们在五战三胜的美联分区系列赛中，从0比2落后的劣势中完成翻盘。克利夫兰将于周一晚在坦帕湾开启美联冠军赛，力争自2016年以来首次闯入世界大赛", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 602, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/62/en_b2.mp3", "duration": 101.988, "size_bytes": 615600, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural", "word_count": 301, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@86b1023/content/data/versions/614.json", "paragraphs": ["Gavin Williams struck out 12, and José Ramírez hit a two-run homer just above home plate as the Cleveland Guardians beat the Chicago White Sox 2-0 on Saturday night. The win completed a comeback from a 2-0 deficit in the best-of-five American League Division Series. Cleveland will open the AL Championship Series at Tampa Bay on Monday night, hoping to reach their first World Series since 2016.", "The Guardians' pitchers struck out 21 batters, the most in a nine-inning postseason game. The White Sox managed only three hits and put just nine balls in play. Over the whole series, Chicago struck out 75 times. Two days after earning the save in Game 4, Williams became only the third pitcher in postseason history to get the last out of a game and then start the next one when his team faced elimination in both.", "Williams did not allow a hit until Kyle Teel looped a knuckle-curve into right field with two outs in the sixth inning. That came two innings after Ramírez homered for the second straight game, a two-run drive off Sean Burke. After a walk loaded the bases, Erik Sabrowski relieved Williams and struck out Munetaka Murakami. Williams's 12 strikeouts tied Cleveland's record for a postseason game, and his 24 strikeouts over three games tied for the second most in a best-of-five postseason series.", "Hunter Gaddis followed Sabrowski and got four outs. Cade Smith finished for his first career five-out save, striking out the side in the ninth. He blew a fastball by Tristan Peters for the final out, setting off a celebration at Progressive Field."], "paragraphs_zh": ["加文·威廉姆斯投出12次三振，何塞·拉米雷斯在好球带上沿击出一支两分全垒打，帮助克利夫兰守护者队周六晚以2比0击败芝加哥白袜队。这场胜利让他们在五战三胜的美联分区系列赛中，从0比2落后的劣势中完成翻盘。克利夫兰将于周一晚在坦帕湾开启美联冠军赛，力争自2016年以来首次闯入世界大赛。", "守护者队投手群共投出21次三振，创下九局季后赛的最多纪录。白袜队仅击出三支安打，只有九个球被打进场内。整个系列赛下来，芝加哥被三振75次。在第四场拿下救援成功两天后，威廉姆斯成为季后赛历史上仅有的第三位在球队面临淘汰时，先拿下比赛最后一个出局数、随后又在下一场担任先发的投手。", "威廉姆斯直到第六局两出局时，才被凯尔·蒂尔将一颗弹指曲球轻巧地打进右外野，形成第一支安打。这发生在拉米雷斯连续第二场开轰之后两局，那是一支从肖恩·伯克手中击出的两分全垒打。一次保送形成满垒后，埃里克·萨布罗夫斯基接替威廉姆斯，三振了村上宗隆。威廉姆斯的12次三振追平了克利夫兰季后赛单场纪录，而他三场比赛共24次三振，并列五战三胜制季后赛系列赛的第二多。", "亨特·加迪斯接替萨布罗夫斯基，拿下四个出局数。凯德·史密斯收尾，拿下职业生涯首次五出局救援成功，在第九局连续三振三名打者。他用一记快速球让特里斯坦·彼得斯挥棒落空，拿下最后一个出局数，点燃了进步球场的庆祝。芝加哥是首支在连续三个百败赛季后打进季后赛的球队，他们自2005年以来再未赢得世界大赛。"], "body": "Gavin Williams struck out 12, and José Ramírez hit a two-run homer just above home plate as the Cleveland Guardians beat the Chicago White Sox 2-0 on Saturday night. The win completed a comeback from a 2-0 deficit in the best-of-five American League Division Series. Cleveland will open the AL Championship Series at Tampa Bay on Monday night, hoping to reach their first World Series since 2016.\n\nThe Guardians' pitchers struck out 21 batters, the most in a nine-inning postseason game. The White Sox managed only three hits and put just nine balls in play. Over the whole series, Chicago struck out 75 times. Two days after earning the save in Game 4, Williams became only the third pitcher in postseason history to get the last out of a game and then start the next one when his team faced elimination in both.\n\nWilliams did not allow a hit until Kyle Teel looped a knuckle-curve into right field with two outs in the sixth inning. That came two innings after Ramírez homered for the second straight game, a two-run drive off Sean Burke. After a walk loaded the bases, Erik Sabrowski relieved Williams and struck out Munetaka Murakami. Williams's 12 strikeouts tied Cleveland's record for a postseason game, and his 24 strikeouts over three games tied for the second most in a best-of-five postseason series.\n\nHunter Gaddis followed Sabrowski and got four outs. Cade Smith finished for his first career five-out save, striking out the side in the ninth. He blew a fastball by Tristan Peters for the final out, setting off a celebration at Progressive Field.", "body_zh": "加文·威廉姆斯投出12次三振，何塞·拉米雷斯在好球带上沿击出一支两分全垒打，帮助克利夫兰守护者队周六晚以2比0击败芝加哥白袜队。这场胜利让他们在五战三胜的美联分区系列赛中，从0比2落后的劣势中完成翻盘。克利夫兰将于周一晚在坦帕湾开启美联冠军赛，力争自2016年以来首次闯入世界大赛。\n\n守护者队投手群共投出21次三振，创下九局季后赛的最多纪录。白袜队仅击出三支安打，只有九个球被打进场内。整个系列赛下来，芝加哥被三振75次。在第四场拿下救援成功两天后，威廉姆斯成为季后赛历史上仅有的第三位在球队面临淘汰时，先拿下比赛最后一个出局数、随后又在下一场担任先发的投手。\n\n威廉姆斯直到第六局两出局时，才被凯尔·蒂尔将一颗弹指曲球轻巧地打进右外野，形成第一支安打。这发生在拉米雷斯连续第二场开轰之后两局，那是一支从肖恩·伯克手中击出的两分全垒打。一次保送形成满垒后，埃里克·萨布罗夫斯基接替威廉姆斯，三振了村上宗隆。威廉姆斯的12次三振追平了克利夫兰季后赛单场纪录，而他三场比赛共24次三振，并列五战三胜制季后赛系列赛的第二多。\n\n亨特·加迪斯接替萨布罗夫斯基，拿下四个出局数。凯德·史密斯收尾，拿下职业生涯首次五出局救援成功，在第九局连续三振三名打者。他用一记快速球让特里斯坦·彼得斯挥棒落空，拿下最后一个出局数，点燃了进步球场的庆祝。芝加哥是首支在连续三个百败赛季后打进季后赛的球队，他们自2005年以来再未赢得世界大赛。", "text": "Gavin Williams struck out 12, and José Ramírez hit a two-run homer just above home plate as the Cleveland Guardians beat the Chicago White Sox 2-0 on Saturday night. The win completed a comeback from a 2-0 deficit in the best-of-five American League Division Series. Cleveland will open the AL Championship Series at Tampa Bay on Monday night, hoping to reach their first World Series since 2016. The Guardians' pitchers struck out 21 batters, the most in a nine-inning postseason game. The White Sox managed only three hits and put just nine balls in play. Over the whole series, Chicago struck out 75 times. Two days after earning the save in Game 4, Williams became only the third pitcher in postseason history to get the last out of a game and then start the next one when his team faced elimination in both. Williams did not allow a hit until Kyle Teel looped a knuckle-curve into right field with two outs in the sixth inning. That came two innings after Ramírez homered for the second straight game, a two-run drive off Sean Burke. After a walk loaded the bases, Erik Sabrowski relieved Williams and struck out Munetaka Murakami. Williams's 12 strikeouts tied Cleveland's record for a postseason game, and his 24 strikeouts over three games tied for the second most in a best-of-five postseason series. Hunter Gaddis followed Sabrowski and got four outs. Cade Smith finished for his first career five-out save, striking out the side in the ninth. He blew a fastball by Tristan Peters for the final out, setting off a celebration at Progressive Field.", "vocab": [{"word": "strike out", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "三振出局", "note": "棒球术语，指投手让打者挥棒落空或被判好球出局", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "homer", "pos": "noun", "zh": "全垒打", "note": "口语说法，正式用 home run", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "comeback", "pos": "noun", "zh": "逆转；翻盘", "note": "常与 complete 搭配，complete a comeback 表示完成逆转", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "deficit", "pos": "noun", "zh": "落后分数", "note": "体育中常指比分落后", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "best-of-five", "pos": "adj", "zh": "五战三胜制的", "note": "表示系列赛先赢三场者晋级", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "postseason", "pos": "noun", "zh": "季后赛", "note": "常规赛之后的比赛阶段", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "elimination", "pos": "noun", "zh": "淘汰", "note": "face elimination 表示面临被淘汰", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "relieve", "pos": "verb", "zh": "接替（投手）", "note": "棒球中指后援投手替换先发投手", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "save", "pos": "noun", "zh": "救援成功", "note": "棒球术语，指后援投手保住领先优势", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "tie", "pos": "verb", "zh": "追平；并列", "note": "tie a record 表示追平纪录", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "celebration", "pos": "noun", "zh": "庆祝", "note": "set off a celebration 表示引发庆祝", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "drought", "pos": "noun", "zh": "长期未夺冠；荒", "note": "如 title drought 冠军荒", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "title_original": "Williams strikes out 12 as Guardians blank White Sox to complete ALDS comeback", "summary_original": "Williams fans 12 as Cleveland win decisive Game 5\nRamírez’s two-run homer provides only scoring\nGuardians to face Rays for place in World Series\nGavin Williams struck out 12, José Ramírez homered on a pitch just above home plate and the Cleveland Guardians beat the Chicago White Sox 2-0 on Saturday night to complete a comeback from a 2-0 deficit in their best-of-five American League Division Series.\nCleveland open the American League Championship Series at Tampa Bay on Monday night, seeking their first World Series appearance since 2016. The Guardians/Indians franchise have not won the title since 1948, the longest drought among MLB teams.\nContinue reading...", "body_original": "Williams strikes out 12 as Guardians blank White Sox to complete ALDS comeback\nWilliams fans 12 as Cleveland win decisive Game 5\nRamírez’s two-run homer provides only scoring\nGuardians to face Rays for place in World Series\nGavin Williams struck out 12, José Ramírez homered on a pitch just above home plate and the\nCleveland Guardians\nbeat the Chicago White Sox 2-0 on Saturday night to complete a comeback from a 2-0 deficit in their best-of-five American League Division Series.\nCleveland open the American League Championship Series at Tampa Bay on Monday night, seeking their first World Series appearance since 2016. The Guardians/Indians franchise have not won the title since 1948, the longest drought among\nMLB\nteams.\nGuardians pitchers struck out 21, the most in a nine-inning postseason game. The White Sox managed just three hits, putting only nine balls in play, and struck out 75 times over the series.\nTwo days after getting the save in Game 4, Williams became just the third pitcher in postseason history to get the last out of a game and start the following game when his team faced elimination in both.\nHe did not allow a hit until Kyle Teel looped a knuckle-curve into right field with two outs in the sixth, two innings after Ramírez homered for the second straight game, a two-run drive off Sean Burke.\nAfter a walk loaded the bases, Erik Sabrowski relieved Williams and struck out Munetaka Murakami.\nWilliams’s 12 strikeouts tied Cleveland’s record for a postseason game. He got 22 swings and misses, and his 24 strikeouts over three games tied for the second most in a best-of-five postseason series.\nHunter Gaddis followed Sabrowski and got four outs. Cade Smith finished for his first career five-out save, striking out the side in the ninth. He blew a fastball by Tristan Peters for the final out, setting off a celebration at Progressive Field.\nChicago, the first team to reach the playoffs after three straight 100-loss seasons, have not won the World Series since 2005.\nExplore more on these topics\nMLB\nCleveland Guardians\nChicago White Sox\nBaseball\nUS sports\nShare\nReuse this content", "fetched_at": "2026-10-12T00:46:14.061014", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "Gavin", "s": 0.1, "e": 0.5, "sm": 100, "em": 500, "cs": 0, "ce": 5, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "Williams", "s": 0.512, "e": 0.962, "sm": 512, "em": 962, "cs": 6, "ce": 14, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "struck", "s": 0.975, "e": 1.262, "sm": 975, "em": 1262, "cs": 15, "ce": 21, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "out", "s": 1.275, "e": 1.475, "sm": 1275, "em": 1474, "cs": 22, "ce": 25, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "12", "s": 1.488, "e": 1.9, "sm": 1487, "em": 1900, "cs": 26, "ce": 28, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": ",", "s": 1.9, "e": 2.275, "sm": 1900, "em": 2275, "cs": 28, "ce": 29, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "and", "s": 2.275, "e": 2.375, "sm": 2275, "em": 2375, "cs": 30, "ce": 33, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "Jos", "s": 2.388, "e": 2.678, "sm": 2387, "em": 2678, "cs": 34, "ce": 37, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "é", "s": 2.678, "e": 2.775, "sm": 2678, "em": 2775, "cs": 37, "ce": 38, "si": 0}, {"i": 9, "w": "Ram", "s": 2.788, "e": 3.002, "sm": 2787, "em": 3001, "cs": 39, "ce": 42, "si": 0}, {"i": 10, "w": "í", "s": 3.002, "e": 3.073, "sm": 3001, "em": 3073, "cs": 42, "ce": 43, "si": 0}, {"i": 11, "w": "rez", "s": 3.073, "e": 3.288, "sm": 3073, "em": 3287, "cs": 43, "ce": 46, "si": 0}, {"i": 12, "w": "hit", "s": 3.3, "e": 3.462, "sm": 3300, "em": 3462, "cs": 47, "ce": 50, "si": 0}, {"i": 13, "w": "a", "s": 3.475, "e": 3.538, "sm": 3475, "em": 3537, "cs": 51, "ce": 52, "si": 0}, {"i"